{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"2TH","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"帖撒罗尼迦后书","commonName":"帖撒罗尼迦后书","title":"帖撒罗尼迦后书","order":53,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"d06899dc062ef78a40595ed97061020d0ece28da87d42eda6b730ed5aaa56052","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TH/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TH/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":47},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["请为我们祷告"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["弟兄们，我还有话说：请你们为我们祷告，好叫主的道理快快行开，得着荣耀，正如在你们中间一样，"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["也叫我们脱离无理之恶人的手；因为人不都是有信心。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["但主是信实的，要坚固你们，保护你们脱离那恶者",{"noteId":1},"。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我们靠主深信，你们现在是遵行我们所吩咐的，后来也必要遵行。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["愿主引导你们的心，叫你们爱 神，并学基督的忍耐！"]},{"type":"heading","content":["警戒懒惰的人"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["弟兄们，我们奉主耶稣基督的名吩咐你们，凡有弟兄不按规矩而行，不遵守从我们所受的教训，就当远离他。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你们自己原知道应当怎样效法我们。因为我们在你们中间，未尝不按规矩而行，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["也未尝白吃人的饭，倒是辛苦劳碌，昼夜做工，免得叫你们一人受累。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["这并不是因我们没有权柄，乃是要给你们作榜样，叫你们效法我们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我们在你们那里的时候，曾吩咐你们说，若有人不肯做工，就不可吃饭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因我们听说，在你们中间有人不按规矩而行，什么工都不做，反倒专管闲事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我们靠主耶稣基督吩咐、劝戒这样的人，要安静做工，吃自己的饭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["弟兄们，你们行善不可丧志。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["若有人不听从我们这信上的话，要记下他，不和他交往，叫他自觉羞愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["但不要以他为仇人，要劝他如弟兄。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["祝福"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["愿赐平安的主随时随事亲自给你们平安！愿主常与你们众人同在！"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["我—保罗亲笔问你们安。凡我的信都以此为记，我的笔迹就是这样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["愿我们主耶稣基督的恩常与你们众人同在！"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"-","text":"或译：脱离凶恶","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":3}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TH/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/1TI/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/2TH/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":18}